Upstream-Name: kidux-module-photography
Source: https://github.com/othermore/kidux
Comment: The guide, its drawings and its page are Kidux's own. The
 photographs under pictures/ that are not Kidux's are listed below one by
 one, with their authors and licences, which pictures/pictures.toml also
 holds and the guide shows under each. A picture marked as made by a
 computer was generated for the guide and is Kidux's own. The guide names
 the Olympus XZ-2's controls and the pages of its manual; nothing of the
 manual, its text or its pictures, is in this package.

